  "description": "FactoorSharp.FacturX.Visualization renders FactoorSharp Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) invoices into a human readable PDF invoice layout using QuestPDF.\n\nUse this package together with FactoorSharp.FacturX to produce a visual representation of an electronic invoice.",
