  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "20.0.0\n* BREAKING: removed Render() and RenderToBytes(); use RenderPdf()\n* Multilingual output (de/en/fr) via PdfRenderOptions.Culture and HtmlRenderOptions.Culture\n* Document title for every InvoiceType\n* Despatch advice reference (BT-16), line-level buyer reference and item notes are rendered\n* Unit prices, quantities and percentages show all significant decimals\n* Updated dependency on FactoorSharp.FacturX to 20.0.0",
